solution:
The difference is \(2112-2021=91=7\cdot13\), and the denominator is \(169=13^2\). Thus the common squared factor cancels:
\[
\frac{(2112-2021)^2}{169}
=\frac{(7\cdot13)^2}{13^2}
=\frac{7^2\cdot13^2}{13^2}
=7^2=\boxed{49}.
\]
The answer is choice \(\text{(C)}\).

